                                "sense_id": "bb79a4dd-b898-36c3-8edb-30cb65bf8d17",
                                "text": "The Magistrates there came into prison, and said, This day you are all to die, and if any of you will undertake to be executioner to the rest, he shall have his life […] The Magistrates gave him Drink and kept him tozy until the murder was over."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "085b7f6e-5baa-4826-a2ba-cbd6b1a92009",
                                "sense_id": "bb79a4dd-b898-36c3-8edb-30cb65bf8d17",
                                "text": "What puir man, whan he's tozy, But spends as he ware bein and cozy?"
                            },
